> Also, for some reason, the prototypes I added to the Array object stopped working

Adding to the Array prototype IS [considered a side effect](https://sgom.es/posts/2020-06-15-everything-you-never-wanted-to-know-about-side-effects/), you should not tree shake that if needed globally.

